{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-cost#card-zh","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-cost","commit":"c7b84a3c5462b53b9c22385c47a997df83a14b60","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost 是面向 DSH 的会话 token 成本账本与预算检查插件，提供 DSH 工具、离线命令行和 stdio MCP 接口。它按会话事件中的 provider/model 路由，将已记录的 usage 与用户价格表对应，汇总已知成本、路由拆分和证据完整度，并可显式检查预算。报告还显示当前上下文 token 压力；缺少 usage 或价格时会标记未知，避免将不完整数据当成总额。适合需要核对会话费用、区分模型路由成本或手动检查预算的 DSH 用户。配置用户自己的价格表文件和可选默认预算即可使用；没有内置供应商价格。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:25-71","lib/ledger.mjs:69-134"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-cost#card-en","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-cost","commit":"c7b84a3c5462b53b9c22385c47a997df83a14b60","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cost tracks DSH session token costs through DSH tools, an offline CLI, and stdio MCP. It matches usage with provider/model routes and a user supplied price book to report costs and evidence gaps. Users can check budgets; missing usage or prices remain incomplete. A price book is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:25-71","lib/ledger.mjs:69-134"]}
