{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-cost#feature-1","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-cost","commit":"c7b84a3c5462b53b9c22385c47a997df83a14b60","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost 的功能「会话成本报告」：汇总当前会话已记录的 usage，并按 provider/model 路由展示调用数和已知费用。调用 dsh_cost_report 工具时触发，报告会区分缺失用量、未定价路由和当前上下文压力。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:28-45","lib/ledger.mjs:69-134"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-cost#feature-2","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-cost","commit":"c7b84a3c5462b53b9c22385c47a997df83a14b60","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost 的功能「显式预算检查」：依据价格表成本和给定预算返回是否允许。调用 dsh_cost_check 工具触发；证据不完整时可选择 fail-closed 或 fail-open，不会自动拦截后续模型调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:47-64","lib/ledger.mjs:116-134"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-cost#feature-3","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-cost","commit":"c7b84a3c5462b53b9c22385c47a997df83a14b60","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost 的功能「离线账本」：从事件 JSON 文件和价格表文件生成成本报告，可附加预算并设置 fail-closed。运行 dsh-cost 命令后输出 JSON 报告；超预算或指定严格模式下证据未知时返回状态码 2。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dsh-cost.mjs:11-29","lib/ledger.mjs:69-134"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-cost#feature-4","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-cost","commit":"c7b84a3c5462b53b9c22385c47a997df83a14b60","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost 的功能「MCP 成本工具」：通过 stdio MCP 接受有限字段的用量行和价格表，提供 cost_report 与 cost_check。客户端调用对应工具后得到成本报告或预算判断，输入不接受额外字段。","source":"generated","evidence":["mcp-server.mjs:5-56","mcp-server.mjs:58-92"]}
